{"text": "On the eighth night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was even more careful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than usual. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A clocks minute hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Moves faster. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than my hand did. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I almost laughed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That he did not know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My secret thoughts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly my thumb slipped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the metal of the lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man sat up in bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Crying out Who is there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I kept quite still. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And said nothing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a whole hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was still sitting up in bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Listening just as I had done. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Night after night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I heard a low groan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the groan of deadly fear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I knew that sound well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because it had often come. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From my own heart at night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last I opened the lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the ray fell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Straight upon the vulture eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was wide open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I grew furious. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As I looked at it.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", "h", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "m", "o", "r", "e", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "n", " ", "u", "s", "u", "a", 